  "limitations": [
    "Cases run with the mock model and no network: network gates are shown failing closed (private address, live search off), not a successful live request.",
    "Remote-model Auto-mode per-call approval is covered by backend/tests/test_agent_loop.py::test_auto_mode_asks_per_call_when_the_model_is_remote, which needs a scripted local HTTP server, not by a case here.",
    "Engine-level cases exercise permission_engine.evaluate directly; tool-runtime cases exercise the full request, approval, execution and audit path.",
    "The restart case reuses the MATRIX-016 process-kill case: a process dies mid tool call and a fresh app reconciles it.",
    "A change to the case list requires a new frozen MATRIX-011 denominator and receipt."
  ]
